{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a69cfa9e5484a6b625a47eefce3391226fd05d2d54f2586a7b16c96f21ed9e62", "ja": "ワガママなお姫様", "zh": "任性的公主殿下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "726ae868752926198836410604ac1f700c2d0b6f808284bd818cb888329e71dc", "ja": "CM撮影当日。緊張しながらも現場入りする\n桃子。監督の提案で、見学に来ていた瑞希も\n急遽CMに出演する事になる。共演する子役\nの陽毬と挨拶を交わすが、いざ現場が始まる\nと彼女はひどくワガママなお姫様だった。", "zh": "广告拍摄当天。桃子虽然紧张，但还是来到了\n现场。在导演的提议下，前来参观的瑞希也\n临时决定出演广告。她们虽和共演的童星\n阳毬打了招呼，可正式开拍后，\n对方却是一个非常任性的小公主。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed39f8e0a1f6d4b20f069ff4dfc713bd759c3ab0c7e8aa7957875aae10a2b4d1", "ja": "（今日はCM撮影当日。子役時代の桃子を知る\n当時のスタッフは、数人だと聞いたけど……）", "zh": "（听说今天是CM拍摄当天，当年认识童星时期桃子的工作人员有几位会来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "262f17a637e67684bc0c3f7776d0027532446e16b69775ed5024e14eaed97881", "ja": "（とはいえ、さすがに桃子は固くなっているな。\nここは緊張をほぐすためにひとつ……ん？）", "zh": "（不过，桃子果然还是很紧张啊。为了让她放松下来，来做点什么吧……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "3999afc7de17ddd9a3a868a7ede9f34a61e079a1d23f8f615d13e2c3ac5b9cf2", "ja": "ここは、手品のひとつやふたつお見せして、\n周防さんの緊張を解したいところなのですが……。", "zh": "我本想在这里表演一两个魔术，让周防小姐放松下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "abce16823c24058cf92666d956785a5cfc6379ec7a707d05b3c320c1054e7e8b", "ja": "今日の私は、見学。さすがに、鳩を\n連れてくることはできませんでした。……無念。", "zh": "今天的我只是来参观的。实在没法带鸽子过来……真遗憾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "a130be342e0c8ee3b3570ed55b299fe07dfa7d57a47184f58b747de6caf092f5", "ja": "い、いいよ、別に。\n桃子、緊張とかしてないし。", "zh": "没、没关系啦。\n桃子又没有在紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "348ed45deba3a3c68503c5722bf15903701e519831c396fbd42d77485df03c5b", "ja": "ですが、周防さんのポケットに\n何か入っているようです。……えいっ。", "zh": "不过，周防小姐的口袋里好像装着什么东西。……嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "57b31abba068647fd84ed0a64c7eabe796afe0daf3cea696867d0de7944ccabb", "ja": "え？　……あっ、鳩の形のチョコが\n入ってる！　いつの間に……。", "zh": "咦？……啊，口袋里居然放着鸽子形状的巧克力！什么时候放进去的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "c87272b7510ea2db5637867ada4aaef7d5dd612a6d90abb24b6bc3b861f177b8", "ja": "どうやら、鳩がついてきてしまったようです。\nですが、現場には連れていけないので……。", "zh": "看来，鸽子也跟着来了。不过，不能把它带进现场，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "4f10218562c9dddafb759a283ec5f62aaf9a4e75603a8fcf561320d684f01025", "ja": "周防さん。現場に入る前に、\nおなかの中に隠してしまいましょう。さあ。", "zh": "周防同学。在进现场之前，\n先藏进肚子里吧。来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "dddbd9b8a25d9f19062b0a9477d043fe1247187a787d988c4f014b84f9e7b3b1", "ja": "う、うん。\n……あ、ありがと、瑞希さん。", "zh": "嗯、嗯。\n……谢、谢谢你，瑞希小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bec4dabb4b0f6955df860df33419e2176b91764d7f9ccccbf2bd13f4da15967a", "ja": "うん。それじゃ、鳩をおなかに隠し終わったら、\nスタッフさん達に挨拶しに行こうか！", "zh": "嗯。那等把鸽子藏到肚子里之后，\n就去跟工作人员们打个招呼吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cc5774b4e69d7bc2e6230aba12b89cdf3741592ab1fd6d66b680224d3d908134", "ja": "お疲れさまです、765プロです！\n今日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "大家辛苦了，我是765制作人！今天请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "4bdbd8bc73744487570dc305d139d0dcf74ca48b2585adb10ee3e796eab383ea", "ja": "よ、よろしくお願いします。\n周防桃子です……。", "zh": "您、您好，请多关照。\n我是周防桃子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1014_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "79a969a5072ae426e657c988470ea57a9e184277eb17096787908c1bb6564727", "ja": "お疲れさまです、今日監督を務めさせてもらいます。\nそんなに緊張しないでくださいね、周防さん。", "zh": "辛苦了，今天由我来担任导演。\n不用那么紧张，周防小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1015_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "a96e58562378e102d79d112c16ad198ff9b39550a95c121861605b960d6641b8", "ja": "いつもどおりにやってもらえれば、大丈夫。\nリラックスしていきましょう！", "zh": "只要和平常一样发挥就没问题。\n放松心态上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "218fbfc1fb5e3ee769332c56bd065501c27bb3c1d9db036f40e6d1b2d17a143a", "ja": "は、はい！\n今日は、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好、好的！\n今天也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "aca3004dd682316c1eb9f6441ec0734ce9cef10c80dcfb3a53400794dd6c4e57", "ja": "（先に瑞希が緊張を解してくれたおかげかな。\n監督さんも優しそうな人だし、桃子もこれなら……）", "zh": "（多亏瑞希先帮忙缓解了紧张情绪吧。导演看起来也是个温柔的人，这样一来桃子应该也……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "7ce19862c2739b9720c3fe503c9613474e0ce98dc0b6a4af5e8002c768c29216", "ja": "見学させていただきます、765プロの真壁瑞希です。\nよろしくお願いします。", "zh": "我是来旁观学习的，765制作人旗下的真壁瑞希。请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1019_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "67de8bee6df913774bbc782b2c22c032555e9ec7415fb7cf8b9c88c21077ebf7", "ja": "あっ、見学って真壁さんだったんですね？\nちょうどよかった！", "zh": "啊，原来来参观的是真壁同学啊？\n来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1020_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "e99b2161f13718ca0fdc5baedde43459b999ab96babb6e6a4e37e251254b85fa", "ja": "あの、{$P$}Pさん、真壁さん。\nもしよかったら、CMの方に軽く出て頂く事は……？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}P先生，还有真壁小姐。如果方便的话，能不能在广告里简单露个脸……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1021_p", "source_sha256": "a8b06f8a8c6617400045575586def169d466280f040b31a2198ccb46fb1755c9", "ja": "え？　瑞希を、CMにですか？", "zh": "咦？让瑞希出演广告吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1022_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "502712ac6dc73e238c702c8d6ed1cdea947aff936456486ab453167c7e74ff52", "ja": "ええ。ショートカットで、雰囲気のある子がいなくて。\nその点、真壁さんならばっちりです！", "zh": "是的。因为还没有那种留着短发、很有氛围感的女孩。\n在这方面，真壁小姐就完全符合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f232401817cb1a0e245c076e980fd3e5acdaf7ee6882f5676c20d1759bf315fb", "ja": "そうですね……瑞希、どうだ？", "zh": "是啊……瑞希，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "57e417b9ca125e9e70ce8eb8d43f5ee44baf5ffff86e8b8f88035ca3f66604de", "ja": "私でよければ、ぜひ。\n……周防さんと、共演したいぞ。", "zh": "如果是我的话，我非常愿意。\n……我想和周防小姐一起演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "701d7de0f280bbadfeebee20dea6d180cd50decc3817ae23d90555cf674e6f93", "ja": "じゃあ、事務的な話は後で改めてという事で……\n桃子と一緒に、頑張ってもらおうかな。", "zh": "那么，事务上的事情之后再正式谈……\n就拜托你和桃子一起努力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "b2722a26eaefd04ef7631130de92a1c3524635114d4966da75332b6de3366126", "ja": "見学のはずが、共演になってしまいました。\n……サプライズ。", "zh": "本来只是来旁观的，结果变成一起出演了。……真是个惊喜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1027_044miz", "source_sha256": "fa10deabd2731d1c49090770d691848ab3a0b80369529a925b684b7fb373c9bf", "ja": "何も準備できていないので、周防さんの演技を見て、\n勉強させてもらいます。……技を盗むぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "我还什么都没准备，所以先看看周防小姐的演技，向她学习一下。……瑞希，我要偷师了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1028_049mom", "source_sha256": "b79e43696c98cd4c48babd3001088a29a89ce4d9651f0e19455d580161ff245e", "ja": "ふふっ、いいよ。\n瑞希さん、桃子の演技、ちゃんと見ててね！", "zh": "呵呵，可以哦。\n瑞希，记得好好看桃子的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2a6a085b1240178b30af5ad88312fe403fc7d13799bddebe5b29dd9ab76cbf12", "ja": "よし、この調子で挨拶して回ろう。\n次は桃子と共演する、子役の子だな。", "zh": "好，就照这个势头去打招呼吧。\n接下来是和桃子一起演出的童星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1030_himari", "source_sha256": "e169b737f0b6fcc7a0c2f1cbae616cd9fd481291997315fecae091ad0b06d023", "ja": "……。\n子役の、ひまりです。", "zh": "……。\n我是演小演员的，日茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "aff59b9de822ecd4a3082b126db0dd9bfb32fe6e1aebe86ee4267acb5ce49578", "ja": "急遽出演することになりました、\n765プロの真壁瑞希です。", "zh": "我是临时决定出演的，\n765事务所的真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1032_himari", "source_sha256": "118ca41e2cf2cf4b0d9ead3428f4333d41a6f13afb5038548458d9e03782b51a", "ja": "アイドルのひとと共えんは、はじめてです。\n今日はよろしくおねがいします。", "zh": "和偶像一起演出，还是第一次。\n今天请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1033_044miz", "source_sha256": "96623847685a7cf40f131713ed7a8adebb4b26e1c70d6c677d54b20a4d5aec23", "ja": "はい、こちらこそ。……今回は周防さんが、\nひまりさんの髪をとかしてあげる役なんですよね？", "zh": "是的，我才要请你多多关照。……这次是周防小姐为日葵小姐梳头，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f4fb30e0194d338baad88b725571202824e76356f30627d38b8b005f4a87320b", "ja": "ああ。昔のCMだと、お姉さん役の人が\n桃子の髪をとかしていたけど……。", "zh": "啊。以前的广告里，是饰演姐姐的人帮桃子梳头，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "31369da1eb2656d68cdf77a652cc8d05607be83086f0d7a55a1d5d6073e70121", "ja": "リメイク版では、成長した桃子が\nひまりさんの髪をとかしてあげる予定だそうだ。", "zh": "听说在重制版里，长大后的桃子会为日葵小姐梳头。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1036_049mom", "source_sha256": "16c47443427cb4ddd5680455bdc2732516512905a0d577838afb8726c2b7ac02", "ja": "小さいのに、ちゃんと挨拶できてえらいね。\n桃子、感心しちゃった。", "zh": "年纪这么小，却能好好打招呼，真了不起呢。\n桃子都佩服你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1037_himari", "source_sha256": "feb33639537f95f7e73d5879c0094c4ac16764040c709a7e09f1460ae40da803", "ja": "……お姉さん役は、\nもしかしてあなたですか？", "zh": "……姐姐这个角色，难道是你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1038_049mom", "source_sha256": "78342494036f8fe150ca69f053474984ca8398cd91e2439adb69a31daf8b3662", "ja": "うん、そうだよ。\n周防桃子っていうの。よろしくね。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n我叫周防桃子。请多关照啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1039_049mom", "source_sha256": "c13fcd2f35daaedb9a0f1c1977ed3e9cbf6aacb91f6075f8a1211d64eb1a9159", "ja": "そうだ、桃子と握手しようか。\n仲良くしようね。", "zh": "对了，要不要和桃子握个手？我们好好相处吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1040_himari", "source_sha256": "6eb7391f338aa059cce8f34125744e304c5f1f5a1ced670c6d823cef9d1e88c3", "ja": "いえ、けっこうです。そういうコミュニケーションは\nひつようとかんがえていないので。", "zh": "不用了，谢谢。\n因为我认为并不需要那种交流。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1041_049mom", "source_sha256": "509c20a4ec54f6c659b667fa1825a7d50db3219c3e7d7046f71666dd9359616d", "ja": "え？　そ、そうなんだ……。", "zh": "诶？原、原来是这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1042_himari", "source_sha256": "04e03494a2013115d33d32c8291df891816dd4fdcc380b2934faa7c2d0b8442f", "ja": "げいのうかいに、なかよしはひつようありません。\nいい仕ごとをしてもらえたら、それでいいです。", "zh": "演艺圈不需要交情。\n只要能做好工作，那就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1043_himari", "source_sha256": "80a1dd58f04a6e9f6b9446afd006277eea2aed4086f265c08f671863c07fb6f6", "ja": "では、うちあわせがあるので\nしつれいします。", "zh": "那么，我还有个会议，先失陪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1044_se", "source_sha256": "da55577bb898d8a9ee681e05a77e2569dab50715b4e0f16f49edeb2dbbbeab1d", "ja": "パタン！", "zh": "啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "97f6ccedbf6f7f0cc7f43db46cfc4eaa725c0b0757f854d6031d8efca03f2e9a", "ja": "行ってしまいました。\n……小さいけど、確実にクール系。だぞ。", "zh": "走了呢。\n……虽然个子小，但绝对是酷系。就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1046_049mom", "source_sha256": "9cca50c4b55901073033c03f6f4d7a9f81253a197287b93599f2a0c29c703cdc", "ja": "クールと言えばそうかもだけど……ちょっと\n生意気じゃない？　お兄ちゃんも、そう思うよね？", "zh": "要说是酷系的话，也确实可以这么说……不过，\n是不是有点太嚣张了？哥哥也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "f11d454b5e634338bfeacb75f742b690754d3ef4d0c16cae90691eed5dc42b4a", "ja": "いや、まあ……ドライな子というか……。\n仕事に対して真剣とも言えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不，怎么说呢……她算是比较冷淡的孩子吧……\n也可以说，她对工作很认真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "cf1624b947e62315a2e0cd1cdf31bd22c05087fc9106f67be7ee162658dd4898", "ja": "さあ、そろそろリハーサルだ。こっちも\n打ち合わせをして、万全の態勢で臨もう！", "zh": "好了，差不多该彩排了。我们这边也开个会，以最充分的准备迎接彩排吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1049_null", "source_sha256": "e92a6193d0ca4c7824ccfe536e233f19e02842bb58e1208397ad12a2097e7164", "ja": "リハーサル中……", "zh": "排练中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1050_himari", "source_sha256": "d03e33817e964c50d8a43b4ed0bfdbecb8864990582dc87cc85a8e1e35fe0cf0", "ja": "……このくしも、あまりよくないですね。わたしの\nかみしつとあってないので、変えてほしいです。", "zh": "……这把梳子也不太好呢。和我的\n发质不太合，希望能换一把。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1051_049mom", "source_sha256": "c92fce94da0ba4d2408f8aaa8564685d49a8942b06b665a47e01b6f6785d249a", "ja": "ま、また？\nこれで3個目だけど……。", "zh": "又、又来？\n这已经是第3个了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1052_himari", "source_sha256": "7e0d22a850b39458bafc44d5ba166920efb088f7760faba9bd825b3c4931e6de", "ja": "それと、ライティングもちょうせいしてほしいです。\nもうすこし、ひくめに……。", "zh": "还有，灯光也想请你调整一下。\n再调低一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1053_cmkantoku", "source_sha256": "27f8ee819cccfd9baf9d99797b97fc52e9ad9fd550a339ae875ea88f269de213", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい。\nそれじゃ、ちょっと調整しましょうか。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。\n那么，我们稍微调整一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1054_049mom", "source_sha256": "1a2a8c7cb58334c8d9954d91505d1206d44721bdcf12d59fdf636bd08ab1716b", "ja": "……。\nもう、ワガママなお姫様……。", "zh": "……。\n真是的，任性的小公主……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0278_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0278_story_02_1055_p", "source_sha256": "011e084581b0db1bf7276b045363e260cfe232a24019fd7a9029a6bd86c96241", "ja": "（仕事に真剣であることは間違いなさそうだけど……\nリハーサルを経て、本番がうまくいくことを祈るか）", "zh": "（她似乎确实很认真地对待工作……不过，经过彩排，希望正式演出能顺利进行吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
